<del></del></span> Recommended Gear for Affliction Warlocks in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="what-is-the-bis-affliction-warlock-gear">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_questionmark.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> What is the BiS Affliction Warlock gear?</h3>With many different sources of gear and loot scarcity in Mists of Pandaria Classic, targeting your absolute Best in Slot gear isn't entirely realistic; instead, we've created a Best in Slot list from the ideal Affliction Warlock drops found in Phase 1 from raids, dungeons, Reputation, and World Bosses to help you decide what to prioritize.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>While raid drops are generally the most reliable way of getting high item level gear, many other items can be just as good, if not better, so you should reference the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-stat-priority-pve">Stat Priorities for Affliction Warlocks</a> to help determine your own BiS gear based on what is available to you.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="bis-gear">Overall Best in Slot Gear for Affliction Warlocks</h3>Raids in Mists of Pandaria Classic will be released in staggered intervals, with a few resets between each raid opening. This means that as the Phase progresses, more of your Best in Slot gear will become available to you. This also means that you will need to find alternatives until your Best-in-Slot items are available. Below we have included three gear planners, corresponding with each raid release.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
