<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="set-bonuses">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_treasurechest02b.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Affliction Warlocks in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The Tier 14 set bonuses available to Warlocks are as simple as they are powerful. The <b>2-piece bonus</b> increases the damage of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=172/corruption">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_abominationexplosion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Corruption</span></a> by 10%, a cornerstone of Affliction's damage-over-time toolkit. The <b>4-piece bonus</b> increases your total damage by 10% while <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=113860/dark-soul-misery">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_warlock_demonsoul.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Soul: Misery</span></a> is active, creating a potent window for burst damage.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-14">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Tier 14 - <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item-set=1143/sha-skin-regalia">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha-Skin Regalia</span></a></span></h3>
