<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_gear_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Professions &amp; Crafted Gear for Affliction Warlocks</span></h2>Professions in Mists of Pandaria offer a variety of bonuses, but their overall power is more balanced compared to previous expansions. Most profession bonuses amount to roughly +320 primary stat or a comparable bonus for secondary stats. You should avoid gathering professions (except Herbalism) when raiding, as they offer weaker or less consistent bonuses than crafting professions. Those looking to min-max will want to combine the short cooldown <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=126734/synapse-springs">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shaman_elementaloath.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a> from Engineering with the proc potential <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=142173/lightweave-embroidery">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightweave Embroidery</span></a> of Tailoring. Below are the best options for Affliction Warlocks, focusing on Intellect, secondary stats, and sustained DPS.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="engineering">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ui_profession_engineering.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Engineering for Affliction Warlocks</h4>Engineering offers unique utility and burst potential through glove tinkers and movement tools. Deciding for yourself when the buff happens increases its utility, as it can be matched with other procs or cooldowns for more synergy.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
