<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shaman_elementaloath.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a> provides +1920 Intellect for 10 seconds (60s cooldown), aligning perfectly with cooldowns like <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=113860/dark-soul-misery">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_warlock_demonsoul.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Soul: Misery</span></a>.</div></li>
<li>
